  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the line $L$ passing through the points $(1,2,3)$ and $(2,3,5)$. The distance of the point $\\left(\\frac{11}{3}, \\frac{11}{3}, \\frac{19}{3}\\right)$ from the line $\\mathrm{L}$ along the line $\\frac{3 x-11}{2}=\\frac{3 y-11}{1}=\\frac{3 z-19}{2}$ is equal to",
